## Overview

MedSync Payor connects healthcare providers with insurance companies through automated workflows for prior authorization, eligibility verification, and claims integration. Launched June 2024, it has grown to 68 customers and $12.5M ARR.

---

## Product Vision

Eliminate the administrative friction between providers and payors, reducing denials, accelerating payments, and freeing staff time for patient care.

